    {
      "text": "churches … were edified, Acts 9:31. things wherewith one may edify another, Rom. 14:19. please his neighbour for his good to edification, Rom. 15:2. Knowledge puffeth up, but charity edifieth, 1 Cor. 8:1. lawful for me, but all things edify not, 1 Cor. 10:23. he that prophesieth speaketh unto men to edification, 1 Cor. 14:3. seek that ye may excel to the edifying of the church, 1 Cor. 14:12. Let all things be done unto edifying, 1 Cor. 14:26. authority … Lord hath given us for edification, 2 Cor. 10:8. do all things … for your edifying, 2 Cor. 12:19. for the edifying of the body of Christ, Eph. 4:12. edify one another, 1 Thes. 5:11 (D&C 43:8; 50:22). which minister questions, rather than godly edifying, 1 Tim. 1:4.",
